  "answer": "The liability limit for lost, damaged, and delayed baggage is EUR 1,500 per passenger, not per bag. Since you had two bags lost, the total liability limit would be EUR 1,500 for both bags combined, provided they were checked in under your name. If you made a special declaration for either bag at check-in, the limit for that specific bag could be increased to EUR 3,000. We recommend contacting our customer service to start the claim process and provide any relevant details about your bags.",
